### =====================================================
### ROVERS
### =====================================================

### 1. Wszystkie łaziki
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers

###

### 2. Łaziki o statusie OPERATIONAL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers?status=OPERATIONAL

###

### 3. Łaziki o statusie LOST
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers?status=LOST

###

### 4. Jeden łazik
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance

###

### 5. Nieistniejący łazik — oczekiwane 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Voyager


### =====================================================
### BATTERY
### =====================================================

### 6. Zmiana baterii
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/battery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batteryPercent": 75
}

###

### 7. Bateria poza zakresem — oczekiwane 422
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/battery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batteryPercent": 150
}


### =====================================================
### COMMANDS
### =====================================================

### 8. Historia komend Perseverance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/commands

###

### 9. Wyślij TAKE_PHOTO
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TAKE_PHOTO"
}

###

### 10. Wyślij DRILL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "DRILL"
}

###

### 11. Komenda do Opportunity — LOST — oczekiwane 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Opportunity/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "WAKE"
}

###

### 12. DRILL do łazika z niską baterią — oczekiwane 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Curiosity/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "DRILL"
}

###

### 13. Komenda bez type — oczekiwane 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

###

### 14. Wszystkie komendy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands

###

### 15. Komendy konkretnego łazika
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands?roverName=Perseverance

###

### 16. Komendy IN_TRANSIT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands?status=IN_TRANSIT

###

### 17. Filtrowanie po łaziku i statusie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands?roverName=Perseverance&status=IN_TRANSIT


### =====================================================
### MISSION
### =====================================================

### 18. Status misji
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/mission/status

### Pierwsza strona
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands?page=0&size=2

###

### Druga strona
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands?page=1&size=2

###

### Paginacja + filtr
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/commands?roverName=Perseverance&page=0&size=5

### Pending commands
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Perseverance/commands/pending

### Emergency hibernate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rovers/Curiosity/emergency-hibernate
